OL,3,GNEWSAKeaton Slater's family demand
OL,4,Akiller face them at sentencing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who killed a 12-year-old boy
OL,7,Fas he walked home from school and then
OL,8,Ffled the country should be forced to
OL,9,Fface his family in court, his parents
OL,10,Fhave told the BBC.
OL,12,FDolars Aleksanders fled to Latvia after
OL,13,Ffatally striking Keaton Slater in
OL,14,FCoventry and evaded police for two
OL,15,Fyears before being extradited to the
OL,16,FUK.
OL,18,FAleksanders, who has admitted causing
OL,19,Fdeath by dangerous driving, is due to
OL,20,Fbe sentenced on 13 November. However,
OL,21,FKeaton's family have been told he may
OL,22,Fnot appear in court.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
